        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Toda embroidery shawl, Geographical Indication tag\n- Places: India, Tamil Nadu, Nilgiri Hills\n- People: Toda tribe\n\nFacts:\n- The Government of India gave a Geographical Indication tag to the Toda embroidery shawl.\n- The Toda embroidery shawl is a handicraft known for making a simple loose garment worn over the shoulders.\n- The Toda tribe of the Nilgiri Hills in Tamil Nadu makes the Toda embroidery shawl.",
